      {
        "id": 57795,
        "name": "Sefirit",
        "username": "Sefirit",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-11T15:54:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Not sure where this discussion is at exactly, but at one point I think it was being argued that the character card is NOT part of the deck and therefore NOT subject to isolated hero.&nbsp; Wouldn't this mean Legacy could Galvanize everyone even if he were isolated.&nbsp; Similarly if another hero were isolated they could get +1 from Galvanize.&nbsp; The same could be applied to Team Leader Tachyon, Visonary, any hero whose base power targets other heros.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>To me this seem pretty contrary to the point of the card.&nbsp; My appologies if this has already been brought up or is in any way irrelevant at this point.</p>",
