      {
        "id": 57797,
        "name": "HeroComplex",
        "username": "HeroComplex",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/bbce88/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-11T16:18:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Before the discussion petered out, it appears that everyone agreed the hero cards were considered part of the deck---possibly that there was a technical ambiguity, but also that everyone agreed on the point such that it wasn't necessary to ask for official clarification.&nbsp; So, no, I don't think there's any dispute that the character cards are considered part of the deck for purposes of Isolated Hero.</p>",
