      {
        "id": 57798,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-11T16:24:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Man, I reread this thread...what a mess.&nbsp;</p><p>For simplicity, Isolated Heros don't see other hero cards and other Heros dont see Isolated Hero cards. Like, pretend they are not even there. Maybe there are nuances that are missed there, but I think it covers most of the \"intent\" bases. I think we overblew something thats supposed to be simple.</p>",
        "post_number": 128,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:33:12.421Z",
